      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPTAIN VALIENTE (11) was a good third two runs back then scored a comfortable win last start over 1730m at this track, getting home by 7 metres after taking an early lead. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Finds a tougher race but another win is on the cards. COONEY CROSS (8) scored at Young two runs ago before having her colours lowered when eighth at her latest appearance over 1730m at this track, beaten 35 metres. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw. Taking on a better field but she is up to the task. NANGARA TULHURST (10) last appeared when third over 1730m at this track four months ago. Keep an eye out for positive market movement. COMPLIMENTRY DRINK (2) found form and finished second two runs ago then came back to earth when she broke following a check and finished a long last over 1730m at this track. Has the benefit of a good draw this time. Can't make any mistakes against this field but she is right in the mix.",
